{
  "model": "voice: HistGradientBoostingClassifier on 36 acoustic features (CREMA-D, EMO-DB, RAVDESS, URDU; originals + 1 augmented copy per clip)",
  "protocol": "Nested and speaker-independent. The ablation split is reused exactly (GroupShuffleSplit test_size=0.2, seed 42; fixed test set = un-augmented clips of unseen speakers). A replication gate comes first. Hyperparameters are searched by GroupKFold(5) over TRAINING speakers only, re-applying the balance-then-fit recipe inside each fold and scoring on fold-validation un-augmented clips, selecting on macro-F1. The test set is used once, for the deployed and the CV-best configs, with a paired bootstrap (1,000 resamples, seed 42).",
